xterm256     Mandelbrot graphics demos and their runtime helpers
BROT_BS.COM  Bill Shen Mandelbrot variant; see BROTINFO.TXT
BROT_PS.COM  Phillip Stevens optimized variant; see BROTINFO.TXT
GCLS.COM     Start xterm256 plot: GCLS zoom x y
SYNC.COM     Synchronously save terminal history before the demo
VTPAD.COM    Emit blank-line padding for plot tests
VTSTART.COM  Start elapsed-time measurement
VTSTOP.COM   Stop/report elapsed-time measurement
